      "extract": "\\label{subsec:volumeoperator} The action of the volume operator is given by~\\cite{Rovelli2014} \\begin{equation} \\hat{V} \\ket{\\iota_\\kappa} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} \\left( 8 \\pi G \\hbar \\gamma \\right)^{3/2} \\sqrt{\\vert \\hat{Q} \\vert} \\ket{\\iota_\\kappa} , \\label{eq:def:vol_op} \\end{equation} where $\\gamma$ denotes the Barbero--Immirzi parameter, and $G$ and $\\hbar$ the gravitational and reduced Planck constant,",
