      "extract": "\\label{sec:chaktabarti} Interestingly, the derivation of the matrix elements of $\\hat{Q}$ was provided some sixty years ago by Chakrabarti~\\cite{Chakrabarti1964}, who referred to it as an operator ``whose classical analog is a volume generated by the three angular momentum vectors\". Chakrabarti was interested in constructing eigenstates, which reflect the permutation symmetry of three particles with angular momentum",
